%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &-7707519409235722339
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Each <b>Quality level</b> defines a set of properties related to Rendering, Textures, Shadows, LODs (level of details), etc.\n\nOne important parameter is the <b>Render Pipeline Asset.</b> It controls several URP-specific features and their quality. Let's inspect one.\n\n1. In the Rendering section of the <b>Quality</b> page, double-click on the <b>Render Pipeline Asset.</b>\n\n2. In the <i>Inspector,</i> in the Lighting foldout, disable <b>Main Light</b> > <b>Cast Shadows.</b> \n\n3. As a result, the Directional Light in the Scene <b>(MainLight)</b> does not produce real-time shadows for dynamic objects anymore.\n\n4. Undo your change."
--- !u!114 &-3504208574421869269
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'In this tutorial, you learned how <b>Quality</b> levels are set, and how <b>Render Pipeline Assets</b>  let you control the advanced rendering features of URP.


      For more details, check out the corresponding <a href="https://docs.unity3d.com/Packages/com.unity.render-pipelines.universal@latest/index.html?subfolder=/manual/universalrp-asset.html">documentation.</a>


      <b>Note:</b> You do not need to save your changes in order to follow other tutorials.'
